    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52886" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰλυπτ-ήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
